    "en": {
      "trackName": "Classic Fifteen puzzle",
      "description": "A simple yet engaging challenge: the numbered tiles are shuffled, and one empty space allows you to move both individual tiles and entire rows step by step to put everything back in order.\n\nPlay anywhere: available on both your phone and Apple Watch - a mini version of the game right on your wrist.\n\nBoosts logical thinking and is perfect for quick breaks. The simple interface and easy controls make the game accessible to everyone!\n\nFeel the excitement of solving the puzzle and dive into pleasant memories! Download now and start your journey to victory!",
